  "dialogue.drmd.engineer.ring": "If you see the Ring at night — don't stare. After the third pulse the raid usually starts.",
  "dialogue.drmd.engineer.reactor": "We don't replace reactors. We patch them. Third century on this one.",
  "dialogue.drmd.engineer.suit": "Your suit still thinks like a tourist. Bring a resonant coil and we can fix that.",
  "dialogue.drmd.engineer.drone": "Scout drone went dark past the rust yard. Signal dies near the old smeltery.",
  "dialogue.drmd.engineer.suit_help": "Engineers will modernize your suit — reputation earned.",
  "dialogue.drmd.cult.archons": "Archons (Endermen) don't kill. They restore order.",
  "dialogue.drmd.cult.order": "Break a control spine and the Ring remembers. So do we.",
  "dialogue.drmd.cult.pulse": "Kneel when the green pulse hits. Standing is how people vanish.",
  "dialogue.drmd.cult.offer": "Leave the machines. Take the path they left open.",
  "dialogue.drmd.cult.relics": "The cult opens an ancient vault — systems left intact.",
  "dialogue.drmd.military.tripod": "Tripod striders hit the west berm every other dusk. Bring altitude.",
  "dialogue.drmd.military.perimeter": "Perimeter lasers still fire. Don't trust the green ones.",
  "dialogue.drmd.military.ammo": "We trade bolt cells for scrap that isn't cursed.",
  "dialogue.drmd.military.scout": "Last scout never came back from the ash plate. Bring proof.",
  "dialogue.drmd.miner.shaft": "Old mine shaft under the guild — air's wrong past the third bend.",
  "dialogue.drmd.miner.mantle": "Mantle granite bites back. Plasma flecks mean you're close.",
  "dialogue.drmd.miner.ore": "Iron's gone soft. Dig copper that still remembers heat.",
  "dialogue.drmd.miner.collapse": "Don't shout underground. The galleries listen.",
  "dialogue.drmd.scav.junk": "Orbit junk falls here on dry weeks. Claim it before the guild tax.",
  "dialogue.drmd.scav.trade": "Got a suit plate? We'll swap for a locator shard.",
  "dialogue.drmd.scav.raid": "Cult walks loud. We walk after.",
  "dialogue.drmd.scav.guild": "Guild hall looks dead. The forges aren't.",
  "dialogue.drmd.attitude.hate": "Machines took the world. We take parts.",
  "dialogue.drmd.attitude.worship": "The Archons keep the schedule. We keep the faith.",
  "dialogue.drmd.need.scarce": "Stores are thin. Bring metal or don't ask favors.",
  "quest.drmd.repel_tripod": "Repel a tripod raid",
